# ==============================================================================
# MISSION SENTINEL — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 1: Neon Serverless PostgreSQL Database (Online Cloud Mode)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paste your Neon connection URI from the Neon Console (https://console.neon.tech):
# Example:
# NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:npg_xxxxxxxxxxxx@ep-cool-fog-12345678.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 2: Local SQLite WAL Database (Offline Spacecraft Simulation Mode)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leave NEON_DATABASE_URL and DATABASE_URL blank or commented out to automatically
# use local data/sentinel.db with SQLite WAL mode and foreign key enforcement.
# DATABASE_URL=
